n\": \"Devin released multiple enterprise features including scoped secrets, ACU visibility control, MCP registry enforcement, and build pinning. Added Devin Review Auto-Fix button, PR Review Chat CI tools, and focus mode (Cmd+Shift+F). Introduced Light Mode (beta), streaming shell output in worklog, and sessions API enhancements.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-08\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.86.0 - GPT-5 and Grok-4 Support\",\n    \"description\": \"Aider v0.86.0 added support for all GPT-5 models and Grok-4 via xAI and OpenRouter. Added Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite Preview model, Kimi K2 model support, and model announcements display. Fixed issues with model settings replacement and improved PostHog analytics. Aider wrote 88% of the code in this release.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Continue\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 1.3.38 - Configs Support and Session History Filtering\",\n    \"description\": \"Continue v1.3.38 added .continue/configs support for multiple configuration files, filter session history by workspace directory, and config.yaml existence validation. Dependency updates including happy-dom, handlebars, and brace-expansion security fixes.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]\n",
      "numLines": 57,
      "startLine": 1,
      "totalLines": 57
    }
  }
